The '''Great Glacite Lake''' is a sub-location in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}. It has lake frozen by {{Item|Glacite}} and surrounded by {{Item|Rough Aquamarine Gemstone|text=Aquamarine Gemstone}} veins.

== Purpose ==
The '''Great Glacite Lake''' is the site of the [[Dead Man's Hunt]].

Currently, fishing in the '''Great Glacite Lake''' does not provide unique [[Sea Creatures]], as hinted by the {{Item|Penguin Pet}}'s ability in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}. However, it is still possible to fish up standard [[Sea Creatures]] to apply the {{Item|Penguin Pet}}'s ability.

